e workings of the criminal law system and specific cases, she will be more positive about the courts and judges as well as demand less severe punishments than when the public does not receive this information."}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data available in consultation with Nederlands Studiecentrum Criminaliteit en Rechtshandhaving. Please contact the datamanager [datamanagement@Nederlands Studiecentrum Criminaliteit en Rechtshandhaving.nl]"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Law"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"attitude change"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"confidence in legal system"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"factual information"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"perception of crime"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"perception of law practice"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2006-02-08"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-01-30"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-01-30"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Subscribers to the Brabants Dagblad, Limburgs Dagblad en De Limburger (N=1386). Before the appearance of the first newspaper jury in the Brabants Dagblad 2000 subscribers to this paper and 2000 subscribers to the Limburgs Dagblad and De Limburger received a questionnaire. One year later, afer 20 readers juries had appeared in the Brabants Dagblad, the same partici